    {
      "id": "p0169-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Crab apples (sometimes spelled \"crabapples\") are a real thing - they're essentially a type of wild apple. They look like smaller versions of regular apples and tend to be very sour or bitter. So the joke here is that Crab Apples in Undertale are literal crab-shaped apples, rather than the real-life crab apples that savvy players might envision.",
        "raw": "Crab apples (sometimes spelled \"crabapples\") are a real thing - they're\nessentially a type of wild apple. They look like smaller versions of regular\napples and tend to be very sour or bitter. So the joke here is that Crab Apples\nin Undertale are literal crab-shaped apples, rather than the real-life crab apples\nthat savvy players might envision.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0910801,
          0.31631429,
          0.70223749,
          0.4014
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.08903174,
          0.3156,
          0.70428584,
          0.40247143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          22,
          23,
          24,
          25,
          26
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Crab apple（也拼作 crabapple）在现实中确有其物，基本上是一类野生苹果，模样像缩小的普通苹果，通常很酸或很苦。笑点在于，Undertale 里的 Crab Apple 真的是螃蟹形状的苹果，而不是熟悉这个词的玩家想象中的现实水果。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 69,
            "end": 78,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
