    {
      "id": "p0169-b011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "From all of this, we can see that the localized item name follows the ideas of the original item name: it contains wordplay, remains apple-themed, and matches the name of a type of real-life apple. At the same time, however, the Japanese name lacks the original's aquatic theme shared by many items found in Waterfall.",
        "raw": "From all of this, we can see that the localized item name follows the ideas\nof the original item name: it contains wordplay, remains apple-themed, and\nmatches the name of a type of real-life apple. At the same time, however, the\nJapanese name lacks the original's aquatic theme shared by many items found\nin Waterfall.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0916434,
          0.81067143,
          0.69187281,
          0.89710714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
